        </span>
      </button>
      <a href={gh} class="doc__quiet">Source on GitHub ↗</a>
    </div>
    <p class="doc__works">
      <span>Works with</span> Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, ChatGPT, and any MCP client.
    </p>
  </header>
